# 📐 Power BI DAX Measures

This file contains the DAX calculations created for the Rental Market Intelligence & Investment Decision Framework Power BI dashboard.

---

# 📊 KPI Measures


## 1. Total Portfolio Value

```DAX
Total Portfolio Value =
SUM(rental_data[Rent])
```

---

## 2. Average Annual Rent

```DAX
Average Annual Rent =
AVERAGE(rental_data[Rent])
```

---

## 3. Average Rent per Sqft

```DAX
Average Rent per Sqft =
AVERAGE(rental_data[Rent_per_sqft])
```

---

## 4. Total Active Listings

```DAX
Total Active Listings =
COUNTROWS(rental_data)
```

---

## 5. Demand Index

```DAX
Demand Index =
DIVIDE(
    COUNTROWS(
        FILTER(
            rental_data,
            rental_data[Demand_Flag] = "High Demand"
        )
    ),
    COUNTROWS(rental_data)
)
```

---

## 6. Average Listing Age

```DAX
Average Listing Age =
AVERAGE(rental_data[Age_of_listing_in_days])
```

---

# 📈 Business Usage

These measures support:

- Executive KPI Dashboard
- Rental Market Analysis
- Location Intelligence
- Investment Decision Making
- Property Performance Tracking


# 🛠 Tools Used

- Power BI
- DAX
- SQL Server
- Excel
